  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  textElement: {fileID: 2139784847}
  dialog:
  - GOOD MORNING, BOSTON
  - I'M DAN NIGHTLY,  HERE WITH TODAY'S TOP STORIES
  - "THE CONTROVERSIAL RELIGIOUS ORGANIZATION, \u201CLIFTED SPIRITS\""
  - HAS OPENED A BRANCH IN BOSTON TODAY
  - 'LEADING TO SOME PUBLIC PUSHBACK. '
  - "THE ORGANIZATION\u2019S OFFICE BUILDING HAS OPENED ITS DOORS TO ALL "
  - "BOSTONIANS LOOKING TO QUOTE \u201CLIFT THEIR SOULS TO HEAVEN\u201D.  "
  - WE ASKED THE ORGANIZATION FOR COMMENT,
  - HOWEVER THEY ONLY REPLIED WITH
